WEBVTT

00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:17,070
I've felt two to three hard lumps in my armpit, left armpit last week, both doctors think

00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:21,870
it's congested lymph nodes and not cancer, doing self-assage.

00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:28,590
Should I expect lumps to soften or decrease in size based upon intensity and frequency

00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:33,630
of massage if it's congested lymph nodes?

00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:41,750
So, some of the things that would make you think it's an increased lymph node is have you had

00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:42,750
a recent infection.

00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:51,270
I've had a cold, you know, something like that that could cause that to take place.

00:00:51,270 --> 00:00:56,870
Was there any other changes where you exercise it more or something like that?

00:00:56,870 --> 00:01:04,150
As you had surgery there's going to be, it's going to be more easy to get lymph congestion.

00:01:04,150 --> 00:01:10,030
So if any of those things take place, those give you a hint that it's congestion.

00:01:10,030 --> 00:01:18,670
If you're doing things to move lymph and it's not changing size at all, then yeah, you

00:01:18,670 --> 00:01:22,870
know, you have to at least think, well, I'll give this certain amount of time that I need

00:01:22,870 --> 00:01:25,870
to get this looked at.

00:01:25,870 --> 00:01:31,630
But, you know, should I expect lumps to soften or decrease in size based on intensity and frequency

00:01:31,630 --> 00:01:36,550
of massage if it's congested lymph?

00:01:36,550 --> 00:01:42,830
If it's due to an infection, you can increase the size of the lymph node and it really depends

00:01:42,830 --> 00:01:47,350
on if the infection goes away, if your cold goes away or whatever you have going on.

00:01:47,350 --> 00:01:52,270
If you don't have a cold, don't have any of that kind of history of that going on, yeah,

00:01:52,270 --> 00:01:57,070
you want to maybe give it a week to see a little change size.

00:01:57,070 --> 00:01:58,070
Okay.

00:01:58,070 --> 00:02:05,470
So let's say worst case scenario, it's cancer in those spots, you know, giving it more

00:02:05,470 --> 00:02:10,910
time and doing some other things to try to move lymph isn't going to make it worse.

00:02:10,910 --> 00:02:17,910
So I would still give more time and air on that side and do everything I can to get motion

00:02:17,910 --> 00:02:21,710
in there and to get move it out of there.

00:02:21,710 --> 00:02:24,910
So yeah, keep me informed on what happens with that.

